**Found**
- **The 4 `verify.sh` symlink failures** come from this test machine. Its home links point to `/Users/anshulj/Dev/dotfiles`, not this repo copy (checked with `readlink -f`). I didn't run `verify.sh` before my edits, so there is no baseline run to compare.
- **`node tests pass` fails:** 209 pass, 9 fail. The 9 are the same herdr `scout-bin` tests that failed in `/tmp/base-tests.txt`.
- **tsc was skipped** because it isn't installed here, so nothing was type-checked.
- **My first `after` run was invalid.** The bg job started before the file it needed was copied, so those runs had no AGENTS.md. I reran it; the numbers above come from the rerun.
- **Pre-existing, not fixed:** `claude/skills/pre-pr-review` dispatches a `challenger` agent that doesn't exist.
